  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ellpeck/PrettyPipes/main/media/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"950\" height=\"418\"></p><p>Pretty Pipes 是一个简单易用、功能全面的物品运输模组。它配备了简单的管道，可以通过模块升级来完成更高级的任务。每个模块都有三个等级，因此 Pretty Pipes 既可以在游戏初期使用，也可以在游戏后期使用。</p><p><br>来看看这些截图吧！</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ellpeck/PrettyPipes/main/media/2020-04-18_01.04.55.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1730\" height=\"902\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ellpeck/PrettyPipes/main/media/terminal.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"718\" height=\"489\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ellpeck/PrettyPipes/main/media/2020-04-18_01.05.17.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"640\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ellpeck/PrettyPipes/main/media/2020-10-17_00.58.03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"587\"></p><p>你可以使用管道扳手进行覆盖。工具提示中会解释如何操作。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">此外，这里有一个关于如何使用此模组设置自动合成的视频：<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wC6pEgNGXGg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fellpeck.de%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ellpeck.de/res/discord\" alt=\"加入 Discord\" width=\"502\" height=\"158\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fellpeck.de%252fsupport\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ellpeck.de/res/support.png\" alt=\"支持我并获得一些酷炫的视觉奖励！\" width=\"640\" height=\"670\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fellpeck\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ellpeck.de/res/nodecraft\" alt=\"\" width=\"502\" height=\"108\"></a></p>",
